{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01M53Z3Kk8eaSqjxg1ydietD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Wrote **`ai-engineering/answers/06-019-precision-vs-recall-fraud-detection.md`** — Q19: Precision vs recall — fraud detection?\n\nKey content:\n- **Concept:** Precision = TP/(TP+FP) vs Recall = TP/(TP+FN); accuracy is useless at 0.1% fraud prevalence\n- **Mechanism:** Cost-function threshold tuning on the PR curve (FP × churn_cost + FN × fraud_loss), F-beta score (β=2 for recall-heavy), PR-AUC preferred over ROC-AUC at extreme imbalance\n- **Example:** Fintech threshold at 0.15 achieving 92% recall at 40% precision; scikit-learn `precision_recall_curve` code snippet\n- **Production angle:** Dollar-loss-prevented/day, chargeback rate SLO (Visa < 1%), threshold drift monitoring\n- **Pitfalls:** Reporting accuracy on imbalanced data; defaulting to F1 without justifying symmetric costs; using 0.5 threshold without PR curve tuning\n\n7 items remaining in the Next queue (Q20–Q26 + validate)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":253,"cache_read_input_tokens":70505,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e176f314-15a3-43b1-b76a-d81d2c866511","uuid":"5cf52fb4-37ca-46b8-85f8-5e8397a8742a"}
